//! task: write
//! ask: Write a sum type with a payload variant and extract the payload in a match.
//! expect: ok
//! refs: §8.6
//! explain: A variant can carry a payload, `casus arborea(mensura)`, and the matching arm binds it: `casus arborea(n)`. The binding is scoped to its arm. `mensura` is the target's `usize` — the type of sizes and indices.

typus Modus = casus ordinata, casus arborea(mensura);

publica functio valor(m: Modus) -> mensura {
    discerne m {
        casus ordinata { redde 1; }
        casus arborea(n) { redde n; }
    }
}
